+
+## Project map
+
+```text
+src/app.tsx                 Customer workspace and AI review flow
+src/cinematic/              Three.js, Lenis, GSAP intro
+src/workflow/               Synergy SDK editor and graph conversion
+src/api.ts                  HTTP error handling
